B.aCz=new A.oT("The Whispering Forest","Forest","Dawn","The trees have forgotten their own names. Shadow Wraiths creep between the roots, feeding on the silence.","Guardian of Roots","The Guardian of Roots rises from the earth. It guards the first Word Stone.","The forest remembers. Birds sing their names again.",B.TL,B.U1,B.T5,B.Up,0.35)
