B.aCx=new A.oT("The Baobab Plains","Savanna","Midday","Across the golden plains, Spirit Bats blot out the sun. The herds have lost the songs that guide them home.","Queen of Wings","A storm of wings gathers. The Queen of Wings will not let the songs go.","The sky clears. The herds hum their old songs and turn for home.",B.S9,B.UL,B.Tz,B.UA,0.55)
