B.aCB=new A.oT("The Village of Drums","Village","Dusk","The talking drums are silent. Forest Phantoms have cursed the village so no one remembers how to greet a neighbour.","Phantom Elder","The Phantom Elder steps out of the smoke, chanting the Curse of Forgetting.",'The drums speak again: "Welcome home, Zuba."',B.Si,B.Sf,B.SW,B.TS,0.3)
